            <h3>NIUA &amp; OpenUSD Physics Gate</h3>
            <div class="meta">Personal open-source lab · OpenUSD · MuJoCo · Rust · MCP · Modal</div>
            <p>Personal engineering project exploring verifiable 3D for agents: an agent submits a robot description, articulated scene, humanoid motion clip, or 3D prop; NIUA validates it against typed physics contracts in Rust, Pixar OpenUSD (<code>usd-core</code> / <code>UsdPhysics</code>), and CPU MuJoCo (<code>simcheck</code> + kinematic joint sweeps) and returns an Ed25519-signed receipt. Open-source components ship as <code>OhaoTech/articulate</code> (OpenUSD/URDF/MJCF emitters, CPU validator, and GLB-to-OpenUSD mesh wrapper) and <code>OhaoTech/niua-deploy</code> (GPU-snapshot Modal serving recipes). Simulation only; no hardware tested.</p>
            <div class="project-tags"><span class="project-tag">OpenUSD</span><span class="project-tag">MuJoCo</span><span class="project-tag">Rust</span><span class="project-tag">Agents</span></div>
